CLOSING_TEMPLATES = [
    "Employees with questions about this policy are encouraged to contact Human Resources at <a href='mailto:hr@acpwb.com'>hr@acpwb.com</a> before taking any action that may be affected by its provisions. The Human Resources Department is committed to providing prompt, accurate, and practical guidance.",
    "This policy will be reviewed by the Human Resources Department no less than annually. Substantive changes will be communicated to employees through the Company intranet and will be acknowledged by electronic signature through the HR system.",
    "{org_name} is committed to the consistent and fair application of this policy. Employees who believe this policy has been applied to them in an inconsistent or discriminatory manner should contact the Human Resources Department or the Employee Relations hotline.",
    "A copy of this policy, together with all related forms and procedures, is available on the Company intranet under the Human Resources section. Employees without intranet access may obtain printed copies from their manager or directly from the HR Department.",
    "Nothing in this policy alters the at-will nature of the employment relationship at {org_name}. This policy is a statement of Company standards and does not create any contractual rights or obligations beyond those expressly stated herein.",
    "The Company thanks employees for their continued commitment to maintaining a workplace that reflects the values described in this and all other Company policies. Compliance with these standards is a shared responsibility and a reflection of the culture we are collectively building.",
    "This policy is effective as of {effective_date} and supersedes all prior guidance on this topic. The Human Resources Department maintains a version history and can provide prior versions upon request for reference purposes.",
    "Employees covered by a collective bargaining agreement should consult the applicable agreement for any provisions that may modify or supplement this policy. Where the CBA provides greater protections, the CBA terms govern.",
    "This policy has been designed to be as clear and practical as possible. {org_name} welcomes feedback from employees and managers about how the policy could be improved and invites written comments to be submitted to the Human Resources Department.",
    "The Human Resources Department will conduct periodic audits to assess compliance with this policy across business units. Findings will be reported to senior leadership and used to inform future policy revisions and training priorities.",
    "Retaliation against any employee who exercises rights protected under this policy is a serious violation and will be addressed through the Company's disciplinary process. Employees who experience or witness retaliation should report it immediately to Human Resources.",
    "Implementation guidance, frequently asked questions, and related forms are available on the HR intranet portal under the policy name listed above. The Human Resources Department updates these resources regularly as questions arise from employees and managers.",
    "This policy was developed in good faith to comply with applicable law. To the extent any provision of this policy conflicts with a legal requirement, the legal requirement governs, and {org_name} will take prompt corrective action upon learning of any such conflict.",
    "The Company's commitment to the principles underlying this policy is ongoing and not limited to the specific provisions set forth above. Employees are encouraged to apply the spirit of this policy in situations not expressly addressed by its terms.",
    "{org_name} will provide reasonable notice of material changes to this policy, except where immediate implementation is required by law or emergency circumstances. Notice will be provided through the Company's standard policy communication channels.",
    "Questions about whether a specific action is permitted or required under this policy should be submitted to the Human Resources Department in writing for a documented response. Verbal guidance is helpful but should be confirmed in writing when the stakes are significant.",
    "By accepting employment with {org_name}, employees agree to comply with all Company policies, including this one. Continued employment constitutes ongoing acknowledgment of and agreement to comply with Company policies as they are revised from time to time.",
    "Employees are reminded that this policy is one component of a comprehensive framework of workplace standards. Full compliance requires familiarity with all applicable policies, not just those directly relevant to a specific situation.",
    "The Company recognizes that policy compliance is supported by a culture of trust, transparency, and accountability. Leadership at all levels is committed to modeling the behavior expected of all employees under this and all other Company policies.",
    "In the event of a legal challenge to any provision of this policy, the remaining provisions will continue in full force and effect. {org_name}'s legal and HR teams will work to replace any invalidated provision with a compliant alternative that achieves the same purpose.",
    "The Human Resources Department thanks all employees who participated in the comment process for this policy revision. Your input has made this document more practical and accessible, and your engagement reflects the collaborative culture {org_name} works to sustain.",
    "Employees who have read this policy and have questions should write them down and bring them to their next scheduled one-on-one with their manager, or submit them directly to the Human Resources Department at <a href='mailto:hr@acpwb.com'>hr@acpwb.com</a>. No question is too basic.",
    "This policy will be enforced as written. The Company does not maintain informal exceptions or unenforced provisions. Employees who are uncertain whether a policy applies to their situation should assume it does and seek clarification before acting.",
    "{org_name} will continue to refine this policy as its workforce, operations, and legal environment evolve. The Company's commitment to maintaining current, compliant, and practical policies is a standing organizational priority supported by senior leadership.",
    "Employees are encouraged to retain a copy of this policy for personal reference. The definitive and always-current version is maintained on the HR intranet; in the event of any discrepancy between a printed copy and the online version, the online version controls.",
    "This policy has been approved at the highest appropriate level of {org_name}'s management structure and reflects the Company's considered position as of {effective_date}. Employees who believe the policy is incorrect or incomplete are encouraged to raise that concern through HR rather than disregarding the policy.",
    "Human Resources will distribute a summary of changes to this policy within thirty (30) days of the effective date. Managers are responsible for discussing the summary with their teams and answering questions within their knowledge; questions beyond a manager's knowledge should be escalated to HR.",
    "{org_name} is proud to maintain a policy framework that reflects both legal compliance and genuine organizational values. This policy is one piece of that framework, and its consistent application contributes to the kind of workplace the Company is committed to building.",
    "The provisions of this policy are not aspirational. They are binding on all employees and will be enforced through the Company's standard disciplinary and investigative processes. Employees who experience or observe noncompliance should report it without delay.",
    "This policy was designed to be read in a single sitting. If any section is unclear, the Human Resources Department welcomes requests for clarification and will provide written responses to written questions within five (5) business days.",
    "Employees separating from {org_name} should review this policy prior to their departure to understand their post-employment obligations, including obligations relating to confidentiality, return of property, and cooperation with ongoing Company matters.",
    "{org_name} measures its success in part by the quality of its employment policies and the consistency of their application. The Human Resources Department is accountable to the Chief Executive Officer for the integrity of the policy framework, and reports on compliance metrics quarterly.",
    "This policy represents the Company's current best thinking on a complex and consequential subject. {org_name} thanks its employees for engaging with this material in good faith and for contributing to a workplace where clear expectations enable everyone to do their best work.",
    "As with all {org_name} policies, this document will be enforced equitably, without favoritism, and without regard to an employee's seniority, title, or personal relationship with management. The Company holds all employees to the same standard.",
    "Feedback on this policy — including suggestions for clarification, concerns about enforceability, and observations about how the policy works in practice — is always welcome. The Human Resources Department maintains an open channel at <a href='mailto:hr@acpwb.com'>hr@acpwb.com</a> for this purpose.",
]

